                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W271A800                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  PROGRAM MATCHES NEW BASE FILE WITH REGISTER           *        
*                FILE W27107. FIND ARTICLES THAT CHANGED ERS CODE      *        
*                TO ZERO.                                              *        
*                WRITE FILE WITH REFILL PROPOSALS                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  ARUP DATTA                                            *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W271A8D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W01160                                                                         
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W271A8D2                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W27108   'OLD-'                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE TEMP VIRTUAL RETAIN FB(18 0)                                               
%W271081 'TEMP-'                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W271A8D3                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W01184 'ALLDC-'                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W271A8D4 FB(058 0)                                                         
*                                                                               
%W27111  'W27109-'                                                              
                                                                                
                                                                                
  DAGENS-SYSDATE                       W   8  A                                 
  SYSDATE-TIAA        DAGENS-SYSDATE       2  N                                 
  SYSDATE-LINE1       DAGENS-SYSDATE   +2  1  A                                 
  SYSDATE-TIMM        DAGENS-SYSDATE   +3  2  N                                 
  SYSDATE-LINE2       DAGENS-SYSDATE   +5  1  A                                 
  SYSDATE-TIDD        DAGENS-SYSDATE   +6  2  N                                 
                                                                                
  DAGENS-DATUM                        W   6  N                                  
  DAGENS-TIAA         DAGENS-DATUM     2  N                                     
  DAGENS-TIMM         DAGENS-DATUM +2  2  N                                     
  DAGENS-TIDD         DAGENS-DATUM +4  2  N                                     
                                                                                
  ADART-NUM           W                  10  A                                  
  WS-ADLAGOMR         ADART-NUM           2  N                                  
  WS-ADGANG           ADART-NUM      +2   3  N                                  
  WS-ADPLATS          ADART-NUM      +5   5  N                                  
                                                                                
  NEXT-WORKDAY                        W   6  N                                  
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WORKAREA                                                                       
*    --- VALID IDDC CODES                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
  WS-IDDC              W  2  A                                                  
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
                                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. MATCH FILES AND WRITE TEMFIL WITH ARTICLES WITH ERS CODE              
*         CHANGED TO ZERO, LAST DAY.                                            
*                                                                               
    JOB INPUT (W271A8D2 KEY (OLD-IDARTNR)            +                          
             W271A8D1 KEY (CLAG-IDARTNR))            +                          
                                         NAME STEG01 +                          
    START(A-INIT)                                                               
    IF MATCHED                                                                  
       IF OLD-KDERS NE 00 AND CLAG-KDERS EQ 00                                  
          IF OLD-KDERS = 09 19 29                                               
             CONTINUE                                                           
          ELSE                                                                  
             MOVE '16' TO TEMP-KDREFTXT                                         
             PERFORM TEMP                                                       
             PUT TEMP                                                           
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
                                                                                
  DAGENS-SYSDATE  = SYSDATE                                                     
  DAGENS-TIAA     = SYSDATE-TIAA                                                
  DAGENS-TIMM     = SYSDATE-TIMM                                                
  DAGENS-TIDD     = SYSDATE-TIDD                                                
                                                                                
  DAGENS-SYSDATE  = DAGENS-DATUM                                                
                                                                                
*    BERÄKNA NÄSTA ARBETSDAG                                                    
                                                                                
  WORK-TIAAMMDD-FOM    = DAGENS-DATUM                                           
  WORK-TIAAMMDD-TOM    = DAGENS-DATUM                                           
  WORK-KDCALL          = 003                                                    
  WORK-KVWORKD         = 0                                                      
  WORK-IDDC            = CDC-SE                                                 
                                                                                
  CALL WORKDAY             USING (WORK-KDCALL     +                             
                                  WORK-DATE-AREA  +                             
                                  WORK-KDSVAR)                                  
  IF WORK-KDSVAR EQ ' '                                                         
     NEXT-WORKDAY      = WORK-TIAAMMDD-NEXT-WORKDAY                             
  ELSE                                                                          
     NEXT-WORKDAY      = DAGENS-DATUM                                           
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
                                                                                
TEMP. PROC                                                                      
                                                                                
      TEMP-IDARTNR        = CLAG-IDARTNR                                        
      TEMP-IDANSK         = CLAG-IDANSK                                         
      TEMP-ADLAGOMR-CDC   = CLAG-ADLAGOMR                                       
      TEMP-ADGANG-CDC     = CLAG-ADGANG                                         
      TEMP-ADPLATS-CDC    = CLAG-ADPLATS                                        
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 2. MATCH TEMP FILE WITH DC FILE, REFILL PROPOSAL ADDED TO FIRST          
*         FOUND DC WHERE ARTICLE IS FOUND                                       
*                                                                               
    JOB INPUT (TEMP KEY (TEMP-IDARTNR)      +                                   
             W271A8D3 KEY (ALLDC-SLAG-IDARTNR))       +                         
                                         NAME STEG02                            
                                                                                
    IF MATCHED                                                                  
       PERFORM SKRIV-W27109                                                     
       PUT W271A8D4                                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
                                                                                
SKRIV-W27109. PROC                                                              
                                                                                
      WS-IDDC               = ALLDC-SLAG-IDDC                                   
      PERFORM S23-CHECK-WS-IDDC                                                 
      W27109-IDPERSON-BUY   = ALLDC-SLAG-IDPERSON-BUY                           
      IF ALLDC-SLAG-FLFLYG  = 'J'                                               
         W27109-KDREFTYP    = 'A'                                               
      ELSE                                                                      
        WS-IDDC             = ALLDC-SLAG-IDDC-REF                               
        PERFORM S23-CHECK-WS-IDDC                                               
        IF WS-IDDC NE '  '                                                      
           W27109-KDREFTYP  = 'B'                                               
        ELSE                                                                    
           W27109-KDREFTYP  = 'L'                                               
        END-IF                                                                  
      END-IF                                                                    
      W27109-IDARTNR        = TEMP-IDARTNR                                      
      W27109-IDDC           = ALLDC-SLAG-IDDC                                   
      W27109-ADLAGOMR-CDC   = TEMP-ADLAGOMR-CDC                                 
      W27109-ADGANG-CDC     = TEMP-ADGANG-CDC                                   
      W27109-ADPLATS-CDC    = TEMP-ADPLATS-CDC                                  
      W27109-ADLAGOMR-SDC   = ALLDC-SLAG-ADLAGOMR                               
      W27109-ADGANG-SDC     = ALLDC-SLAG-ADGANG                                 
      W27109-ADPLATS-SDC    = ALLDC-SLAG-ADPLATS                                
      MOVE ZEROES           TO W27109-IDDISTR                                   
      MOVE ZEROES           TO W27109-IDKUNDNR                                  
      MOVE ZEROES           TO W27109-KVBEART                                   
      W27109-KDREFORS       = 'P'                                               
      W27109-IDLEVNR        = ALLDC-SLAG-IDLEVNR                                
      W27109-KDREFTXT       = TEMP-KDREFTXT                                     
      MOVE ZEROES           TO W27109-KDFRAKT                                   
      MOVE ZEROES           TO W27109-KVBEART-CD                                
      MOVE ZEROES           TO W27109-ADLAGOMR-CD                               
      MOVE ZEROES           TO W27109-ADGANG-CD                                 
      MOVE ZEROES           TO W27109-ADPLATS-CD                                
      MOVE ALLDC-SLAG-IDDC-REF TO W27109-IDDC-REF                               
END-PROC                                                                        
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*    --- S23-CHECK-WS-IDDC (MACRO PROCEDURE)                                    
%WWDC02 'WS-'                                                                   
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
